								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It was &quot;suggested&quot; that my son&#039;s Shammy&#039;s Ginor should have used Cologist for his surname (thankfully he chose something else).<br /><br />In-game marriage between Needaa Runningwolfe and Mauch Meatshield nearly netted me Needaa Meatshield but at the last minute he was adopted by Joyless Saliatus, hence I was saved.<br /><br />I thought Cattgut Yertongg (Vah Shir) and Toadillie Awwsome (Froglok) were cute.   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
