								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1116.msg11101#msg11101">Re: What is your favorite perverted or funny surname you have seen on RN</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> September 13, 2004, 10:03:31 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							There was a druid, I remember from long ago, that I always thought was pretty funny,Twigue Antuberries&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> .&nbsp; 
