									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><span style="color: DarkGreen;">Tavaran Halfelven</span><br /><span style="color: DarkGreen;">65th Ranger of Tunare</span><br />Dendrabates Azureus<br />65th Shaman of Mithaniel Marr<br />Euman D&#039;Argentus<br />64th Cleric of Tunare<br />Skrar Gnomechef<br />62nd Warrior of Rallos Zek<br />Celare D&#039;Argentus<br />62nd Sorceress of Solusek Ro
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
