							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Damn Colleen, I remember you from way back early kunark with the open wide name.&nbsp; when I spoke with you most recently I wondered if you were the same.&nbsp; If memory serves, you REALLY wanted a wurmslayer back then&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />I have one banked somewhere if ya still need it!
